  "content": "<p><span>這是 ItemPhysic 的完整版本。若要在原版伺服器上使用，則需安裝在伺服器端，請使用&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/itemphysic-lite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemPhysic Lite</a><span>。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00\">需要 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore</a></span></p><p><strong>功能特色</strong></p><ul>\n<li>物品漂浮</li>\n<li>僅有可燃物品會在岩漿/火焰中燃燒</li>\n<li>自訂拾取方式</li>\n<li>自訂投擲功能</li>\n<li>點燃物品</li>\n<li>可設定消失時間</li>\n<li>仙人掌不會破壞物品</li>\n<li>強化物品動畫效果</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2076336-itemphysic-1-3-4-more-realtistic-items-stone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">舊版下載</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">想找個伺服器和朋友一起玩嗎？我們的贊助商已經準備好了：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n[![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fimages%252flogos%252fdark_text%25401538x500.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png</a>)](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamcreative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/teamcreative</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">使用優惠碼 **teamcreative**，即可享有任何遊戲伺服器首月 25% 折扣！</p><p><strong>附加元件</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/itemphysic-guns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemPhysic Guns</a>： \n這是 ItemPhysic（Lite 或 Full 版本）的附加元件，可修正來自 TaCZ 和 Superb Warfare 的 3D 槍枝在掉落時的顯示問題。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creativemd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/g2vJewK.png\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/W9QM3fS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/YF5WrZ1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
